    <credit type="author">
      <name>Reuben Rissler</name>
      <email>pygtk.posting@gmail.com</email>
    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>Sales tax collected</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Sales tax collected</gui></guiseq> adds up
  the tax on posted invoices between the <gui>Start date</gui> and <gui>End
  date</gui>, for each <link xref="tax_rates">tax rate</link>, with the sales
  it was charged on. Click the icon in each date to choose it. <gui>Total Tax
  :</gui> and <gui>Total Sales :</gui> are below the list: what to report on
  your sales tax return.</p>

</page>
